      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every spring, the Vanceboro Strawberry Festival lights Main Street with a parade, food, and games held at the Farm Life Elementary School grounds.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
